## 📖 Overview

This repository contains **28 SQL JOIN practice questions** designed to strengthen your understanding of SQL joins and filtering techniques.

The questions are based on three sample tables:

- Employees
- Departments
- Projects

The practice set covers beginner to intermediate SQL concepts commonly asked in interviews.

