## Q4. List ALL employees with their department name; show NULL when the employee has no matching department.

```sql
SELECT e.emp_id,
       e.emp_name,
       e.dept_id,
       d.dept_name
FROM employees e
LEFT JOIN departments d
ON e.dept_id = d.dept_id;
```

