## Q5. List ALL departments with their projects; departments with no project must still appear.

```sql
SELECT d.dept_id,
       d.dept_name,
       p.proj_name,
       p.budget
FROM departments d
LEFT JOIN projects p
ON d.dept_id = p.dept_id;
```

