## Q6. Find only those employees who do NOT belong to any valid department.

```sql
SELECT e.emp_id,
       e.emp_name,
       e.dept_id
FROM employees e
LEFT JOIN departments d
ON e.dept_id = d.dept_id
WHERE d.dept_id IS NULL;
```

