## Q7. List ALL departments and any employees in them, using a RIGHT JOIN with employees on the left.

```sql
SELECT e.emp_name,
       d.dept_id,
       d.dept_name
FROM employees e
RIGHT JOIN departments d
ON e.dept_id = d.dept_id;
```

