## Q8. List ALL projects and the department that owns them, keeping projects that point to a missing department.

```sql
SELECT d.dept_name,
       p.proj_id,
       p.proj_name,
       p.dept_id
FROM departments d
RIGHT JOIN projects p
ON d.dept_id = p.dept_id;
```

