## Q9. Find departments that currently have NO employee assigned.

```sql
SELECT d.dept_id,
       d.dept_name,
       d.location
FROM departments d
LEFT JOIN employees e
ON d.dept_id = e.dept_id
WHERE e.emp_id IS NULL;
```

