## Q27. Pair employees who work in the same city (avoid duplicate pairs and self-pairing).

```sql
SELECT e1.emp_name AS employee_1,
       e2.emp_name AS employee_2,
       e1.city
FROM employees e1
INNER JOIN employees e2
ON e1.city = e2.city
AND e1.emp_id < e2.emp_id;
```

